1
00:00:03,954 --> 00:00:06,204
你该看看乔安娜当时的表情
You should have seen the look on Joanna's face.

2
00:00:06,538 --> 00:00:09,454
她之前从未输那么惨过
I don't think she'd ever lost a fight before that.

3
00:00:09,496 --> 00:00:11,954
至少不是光明正大得输过
At least, not fair and square,

4
00:00:20,954 --> 00:00:22,829
艰难的一晚啊
Tough crowd tonight.

5
00:00:22,913 --> 00:00:26,288
我觉得埃隆伍德该投资点更好的西冰库满汉全席
Guess Ironwood should have paid for better cell block entertainment.

6
00:00:27,204 --> 00:00:29,829
他笑了 我赢了吗?
And he smiles. Did I win?

7
00:00:30,371 --> 00:00:33,954
你的游戏 你的规则
Hey, it's your game. I don't make the rules.

8
00:00:35,954 --> 00:00:38,329
对之前的事 很抱歉
I'm sorry, for what happened.

9
00:00:39,121 --> 00:00:40,621
那不是你的错
It wasn't your fault.

10
00:00:40,663 --> 00:00:42,121
就是我的错
It was though.

11
00:00:42,538 --> 00:00:46,788
我与黑暗交易 然后他付出了代价
I made a deal with the darkness, and he paid the price.

12
00:00:47,579 --> 00:00:51,746
情况变化得太快了 但克洛弗就是不肯停下来
It was all happening so fast,but Clover wouldn't let up.

13
00:00:51,829 --> 00:00:54,704
我们本可以一起对付特里安 只要克洛弗...
We could have worked against Tyrian if Clover just...

14
00:00:58,038 --> 00:01:00,079
但最刺痛人的是
But the thing that really stings,

15
00:01:00,579 --> 00:01:08,746
有生以来第一次 我想着也许 也许我可以和某人亲近 任何人
for the first time in a while, I thought maybe, maybe I could be around somebody. Anybody.

16
00:01:08,996 --> 00:01:14,246
不会被我的外像力搞得很复杂
Without my semblance making it complicated.

17
00:01:15,413 --> 00:01:19,579
现在这一切都像幼稚的梦想
And now it just feels like a childish dream.

18
00:01:20,454 --> 00:01:21,246
没了
Gone

19
00:01:21,621 --> 00:01:23,121
像所有人一样
like everybody else.

20
00:01:24,788 --> 00:01:28,788
你知道吗 我还是了解这种感受的
Believe it or not, I know a little of what that's like.

21
00:01:29,704 --> 00:01:34,788
当人们觉得你要探究他们的秘密 他们都会把你推开
When people are worried you're gonna sniff out their secrets, they tend to push you away.

22
00:01:35,538 --> 00:01:40,204
这就很难产生真正的联系
It makes a real connection difficult.

23
00:01:40,621 --> 00:01:44,288
我从来没这么想
I never thought of it that way.

24
00:01:47,538 --> 00:01:49,079
你不配拿着那东西
You don't get to keep that.

25
00:01:49,329 --> 00:01:51,371
我没有杀他
I didn't kill him.

26
00:01:52,121 --> 00:01:53,413
你一直那么说
You keep saying that,

27
00:01:53,871 --> 00:01:56,579
但是你的武器沾满他的血
but it was your weapon covered in his blood.

28
00:01:57,871 --> 00:02:00,579
如果你个莫西干头真想知道发生了什么
If you really want to know what happened mohawk,

29
00:02:00,621 --> 00:02:03,121
为什么不打开牢房握着我的手
why not open the cell and take my hand.

30
00:02:04,954 --> 00:02:08,329
如果我打开牢房 那可就不是握手了
If I open this cell, it won't be to shake hands.

31
00:02:08,704 --> 00:02:11,496
是啊 因为你根本不在乎真相
Yeah. Because you don't care about the truth.

32
00:02:11,538 --> 00:02:13,746
你只想找个人发泄
You just want someone to be mad at.

33
00:02:14,496 --> 00:02:17,204
这可比思考自己的立场容易多了
Easier than taking an honest look at what side you're on.

34
00:02:21,829 --> 00:02:24,288
哈尔 你在干什么?
Hare, what are you doing?

35
00:02:28,246 --> 00:02:28,871
没事
Nothing.

36
00:02:36,496 --> 00:02:41,121
真是的 差点就有好戏了
Well, that was almost exciting.

37
00:02:49,704 --> 00:02:51,288
他会在这些山峦甩掉我们的
He's going to lose us in these mountains.

38
00:02:51,329 --> 00:02:52,538
我们跟不上
We can't keep up.

39
00:02:58,038 --> 00:03:00,996
我不知道摩托还能在严寒中坚持多久
I don't know how much longer these bikes can stand the cold.

40
00:03:01,079 --> 00:03:03,538
我真希望我们当中有人能飞
I'm really wishing one of us could fly right now.

41
00:03:04,913 --> 00:03:06,413
等等 把住
Wait. Hold on.

42
00:03:07,454 --> 00:03:09,788
Ren!我来把你射上天
Ren! I'm going to get you up there.

43
00:03:20,621 --> 00:03:21,413
好耶!
Nice!

44
00:03:26,663 --> 00:03:28,246
好吧 有点痛
Okay, not as nice.

45
00:03:29,663 --> 00:03:32,246
拖慢他 坚持住Ren!
Slowing him down. Hold on Ren!

46
00:03:32,329 --> 00:03:34,246
我也没得选啊
I don't have much of a choice.

47
00:04:14,746 --> 00:04:16,871
它刚刚是不是叫援兵了?
Did it just call for back up?

48
00:04:42,288 --> 00:04:43,371
Jaune!
Jaune!

49
00:05:49,913 --> 00:05:52,329
噢 你可真是会挑时间-
Oh, you've picked a fine time to-

50
00:05:52,371 --> 00:05:53,913
再说一个字
Not another word.

51
00:05:54,746 --> 00:05:55,913
我们要进来了
We're coming in.

52
00:05:57,496 --> 00:06:00,246
在你'孝敬'父亲后事情已经很糟了
Things are already bad enough after what you did to father.

53
00:06:00,454 --> 00:06:02,746
现在你还想我们私藏逃犯?
Now you want us to harbor fugitives too?

54
00:06:03,079 --> 00:06:05,079
我们可是名门望族
Our family has a reputation.

55
00:06:06,871 --> 00:06:08,246
你就关心这?名望?
That's what you're worried about? Your reputation?

56
00:06:08,371 --> 00:06:09,079
说说而已
I'm just saying

57
00:06:09,121 --> 00:06:11,079
家里的佣人们都跑了
that we've already lost all the house staff,

58
00:06:11,163 --> 00:06:13,079
母亲把自己锁在房里
and mother locked herself in her room.

59
00:06:13,121 --> 00:06:15,246
也许你还没意识到发生了什么 惠特利
Maybe you haven't figured out what's going on, Whitley,

60
00:06:15,288 --> 00:06:17,496
但我们还忙着拯救擎天
but we're busy trying to save Atlas.

61
00:06:17,538 --> 00:06:19,121
听着 我们朋友受伤了
Look.Our friend is hurt.

62
00:06:19,246 --> 00:06:23,079
我们只是想有个地方躲一会让她恢复 然后我们就离开
We just need a place to-lay low while she rests,and then we'll be out of your way.

63
00:06:24,829 --> 00:06:27,704
行吧 你想我干什么
Fine. What do you expect me to do then?

64
00:06:28,954 --> 00:06:30,538
回你房间
Go to your room.

65
00:06:35,871 --> 00:06:36,746
这边
This way.

66
00:06:41,413 --> 00:06:42,371
Ruby?
Ruby?

67
00:06:43,329 --> 00:06:45,163
我希望一切安好
I hope everyone's doing all right.

68
00:06:45,329 --> 00:06:48,704
如果你担心Yang 可以随时呼叫她
If you're worried about Yang, you could always try calling her.

69
00:06:49,371 --> 00:06:52,538
但问题是 我已经呼叫了
But that's the thing. I did.

70
00:06:56,538 --> 00:06:58,829
重复 如果任何人听到我
I repeat, if anybody can hear me.

71
00:07:01,496 --> 00:07:03,288
我们得想办法回曼特
We need transport back to Mantle.

72
00:07:10,788 --> 00:07:13,996
我们得在严寒把我们的元气耗尽前离开这鬼地方
We need to get out of this weather before the cold drops our Auras completely.

73
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:15,913
离前哨还有多远?
How much farther to the outpost?

74
00:07:18,496 --> 00:07:19,663
Ren?离前哨还-
Ren? How much-

75
00:07:19,704 --> 00:07:20,371
我不知道
I don't know.

76
00:07:27,871 --> 00:07:29,996
你不是说你在空中时看到了吗?
I thought you said you saw it when you were up in the air?

77
00:07:30,163 --> 00:07:33,121
我是看到了 但那是在我解开自己来救你们之前
I did. Before I had to cut myself loose to help you guys.

78
00:07:33,538 --> 00:07:36,538
是啊 你提了好几次了
Yeah. You've brought that up a couple times now.

79
00:07:37,038 --> 00:07:38,496
你想说什么?
Something you need to say?

80
00:07:38,538 --> 00:07:41,163
没什么 我不想再浪费时间了
Not really. Wouldn't want to waste any more time.

81
00:07:44,621 --> 00:07:46,788
喂 你什么毛病?
Hey, what is your deal?

82
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:48,329
你别管了
Don't worry about it.

83
00:07:48,371 --> 00:07:51,538
事态没有你想象中顺利我也很抱歉
Well, I'm sorry things aren't going smoothly enough for you.

84
00:07:51,579 --> 00:07:51,996
你们俩够了
Guys.

85
00:07:52,038 --> 00:07:53,954
事态根本就不顺利
They're not going smoothly at all.

86
00:07:53,996 --> 00:07:54,913
虽然我不想这么说
I hate to break it to you,

87
00:07:54,954 --> 00:07:56,329
但这就是成为猎人需要面对的一部分
but that's part of being a Huntsman.

88
00:07:56,371 --> 00:07:57,204
你在开玩笑吗?
Are you kidding?

89
00:07:57,246 --> 00:07:59,246
我们根本不知道怎么成为猎人
We don't know the first thing about being Huntsmen.

90
00:07:59,288 --> 00:08:00,496
我们明显没有准备好
We clearly weren't ready.

91
00:08:00,621 --> 00:08:01,704
你们俩别吵了
Guys, stop it.

92
00:08:01,746 --> 00:08:03,704
我们保住避风港的时候没有准备好吗
Were we not ready when we saved Haven,

93
00:08:03,746 --> 00:08:05,538
我们击败了一只利维坦时也是没准备好?
when we took down a Leviathan?

94
00:08:05,579 --> 00:08:07,079
我们把提灯送到了擎天
We got the lamp to Atlas.

95
00:08:07,121 --> 00:08:08,204
然后我们把它弄丢了
And then we lost it.

96
00:08:08,246 --> 00:08:12,329
在那之后 我们做的每一个选择都是错的
And after that, when we had to make real decisions, we got every single one wrong.

97
00:08:12,371 --> 00:08:14,954
我不会装作我们好像一切都做得很完美的样子
I'm not going to pretend like we did everything perfectly,

98
00:08:15,038 --> 00:08:18,246
但如果我们什么都没做 事态只会比现在要更加差劲
but if we'd done nothing, things would be even worse than they are now.

99
00:08:18,288 --> 00:08:19,704
状况还要怎么比现在更差劲?
How could they possibly be worse?

100
00:08:19,746 --> 00:08:22,538
我们被困在这个鬼地方 而塞伦掌握着提灯和奥斯卡
We are stuck out here while Salem has the lamp and Oscar.

101
00:08:22,621 --> 00:08:24,246
我们没有计划 没有军队
We've got no plan, no army.

102
00:08:24,288 --> 00:08:25,496
我们有少女
We've got the Maiden.

103
00:08:25,538 --> 00:08:27,579
就为了防止她为埃隆伍德打开宝库
And by keeping her from opening the vault for Ironwood,

104
00:08:27,621 --> 00:08:30,038
我们为塞伦困住了整个城市
we're just trapping the whole city, for Salem.

105
00:08:30,538 --> 00:08:33,829
会有人因我们而死
People are going to die, because of us.

106
00:08:33,871 --> 00:08:36,621
所以呢?我们就应该让埃隆伍德为所欲为吗?
So what? We should just give Ironwood what he wants?

107
00:08:36,704 --> 00:08:37,871
舍弃曼特城?
Abandon Mantle?

108
00:08:38,038 --> 00:08:39,954
你觉得擎天能在她在场的情况下
You think Atlas is still going to be able to float

109
00:08:39,996 --> 00:08:41,371
升空去到安全的地方吗?
to safety now that she's here?

110
00:08:41,413 --> 00:08:41,996
我不知道
I don't know.

111
00:08:42,038 --> 00:08:44,163
但那不是我们应该做的决定
But these aren't the kinds of decisions we should be making

112
00:08:44,204 --> 00:08:45,663
因为我们根本不知道自己在做什么
because we have no idea what we're doing.

113
00:08:45,704 --> 00:08:47,788
好了 你们两个人 不要再说了
Okay. Both of you, cut it out.

114
00:08:47,913 --> 00:08:50,246
我只是在说其他人不愿说的事实
I'm just saying what nobody else wants to.

115
00:08:50,329 --> 00:08:51,538
我们太自以为是了
We are in way over our heads.

116
00:08:51,621 --> 00:08:52,954
Ruby只是个刚长大的孩子
Ruby is barely more than a kid,

117
00:08:53,038 --> 00:08:54,788
而我只是个从小破地方来的孤儿
I'm just an orphan from the middle of nowhere-

118
00:08:54,829 --> 00:08:55,246
Ren 我
Ren, I-

119
00:08:55,288 --> 00:08:57,371
你是作弊才进了信标学院
You cheated your way into Beacon.

120
00:09:05,704 --> 00:09:07,913
你觉得我们不该当猎人?可以
You don't think we should be Huntsmen? Fine.

121
00:09:08,579 --> 00:09:09,996
但我要先离开这个冷得要死的地方
But I'm getting out of the cold.

122
00:09:12,163 --> 00:09:13,621
还有要做的事呢
Still gotta job to do.

123
00:09:15,829 --> 00:09:18,913
说真的 你的目标就是把所有人从你身边推走吗?
Seriously, is your goal just to push everyone away?

124
00:09:23,746 --> 00:09:24,871
奥斯卡?
Oscar?

125
00:09:26,704 --> 00:09:29,538
别害怕 我们不会有事的
Don't panic. We're going to be okay.

126
00:09:30,121 --> 00:09:30,788
什么?
What?

127
00:09:34,538 --> 00:09:36,746
我好久不见的奥斯玛
My long lost Ozma.

128
00:09:37,954 --> 00:09:40,121
终于找到你了
Found, at last.

129
00:09:45,496 --> 00:09:48,038
你的新宿体可真小
So small this new host of yours.

130
00:09:49,121 --> 00:09:51,621
我的猎犬没把你玩坏可真是奇迹
It's a wonder my hound didn't break you.

131
00:09:56,288 --> 00:10:00,954
距我们上次像这样面对面相见 已经过了多少年了?
It's been how many years since we saw each other like this, face to face?

132
00:10:01,746 --> 00:10:03,496
你就没什么要说的吗?
And nothing to say?

133
00:10:05,913 --> 00:10:09,704
抱歉 这次重聚不像你想象的那样
I'm sorry the reunion isn't living up to your expectations.

134
00:10:14,579 --> 00:10:19,079
孩子 你可以装 但你并不完全是他
You can pretend boy, but you're not fully him.

135
00:10:20,163 --> 00:10:21,579
至少暂时还不是
Not yet at least.

136
00:10:26,038 --> 00:10:30,371
或许 你 可以跟我有段更健康的感情
Well, perhaps you and I can have a better working relationship.

137
00:10:30,788 --> 00:10:32,246
奥斯卡是吗?
Oscar, was it?

138
00:10:33,954 --> 00:10:35,454
信标圣物
The Beacon Relic.

139
00:10:35,829 --> 00:10:37,246
我的手下没能
My forces have been unable

140
00:10:37,288 --> 00:10:39,371
找到藏在学校地下的圣物
to locate the relic beneath the school.

141
00:10:39,871 --> 00:10:43,996
如果我了解我的奥斯玛的话 他一定是用了什么障眼法
If I know my Ozma, he has used some means of deception

142
00:10:44,038 --> 00:10:46,538
将这个地点的圣物用不同的方式隐藏了起来
to hide its location differently than the others.

143
00:10:48,371 --> 00:10:49,913
我需要知道它在哪
I need to know where it is.

144
00:10:50,663 --> 00:10:51,163
我...

145
00:10:52,288 --> 00:10:54,579
这不是我知道的事
That's not something I know about.

146
00:10:55,288 --> 00:11:00,079
当然 你会尽力不透露它 越久越好
Of course, you would keep that one guarded as long as possible.

147
00:11:02,246 --> 00:11:04,413
那就来点简单的
How about something easier, then?

148
00:11:06,413 --> 00:11:08,829
提灯的密码
The password for the lamp.

149
00:11:11,121 --> 00:11:13,413
提灯已经耗尽问题了
The lamp is all out of questions.

150
00:11:33,579 --> 00:11:37,788
说起谎来不眨眼睛
The lies come out of you so easily.

151
00:11:40,704 --> 00:11:44,746
真是相似的灵魂啊
Like-minded souls indeed.

152
00:11:45,788 --> 00:11:48,246
你们之中总有一个要告诉我的
One of you is going to tell me what you know.

153
00:11:48,288 --> 00:11:51,121
我也不在乎是你还是奥斯玛
I don't much care if it is you, or Ozma.

154
00:11:51,788 --> 00:11:55,538
反正我都会得到圣物
Either way, I'llfinally have the relic.

155
00:11:57,038 --> 00:11:59,121
我什么都不会说的
I won't tell you anything.

156
00:12:00,788 --> 00:12:01,704
唔
-Hm.

157
00:12:03,329 --> 00:12:04,538
黑泽尔
Hazel?

158
00:12:06,163 --> 00:12:07,663
等等 等等!
Wait, wait!

159
00:12:10,704 --> 00:12:13,538
这是为了避风港学院的事
That was for Haven Academy.

160
00:12:17,621 --> 00:12:21,871
剩下的一切 都是为了我妹妹
Everything that follows, will be from my sister.

161
00:12:28,579 --> 00:12:30,579
大人 我...
Your grace, I...

162
00:12:31,913 --> 00:12:34,579
这 是什么?
What, is that?

163
00:12:34,621 --> 00:12:36,871
一个实验
An experiment.

164
00:12:38,704 --> 00:12:41,538
目前我对结果很满意
So far I am pleased with the results.

165
00:12:41,579 --> 00:12:43,538
你需要什么吗 馨德?
Did you need something Cinder?

166
00:12:43,829 --> 00:12:48,329
是的 我 我想要搜寻冬之少女
Yes. I, I want to search for the Winter Maiden.

167
00:12:48,371 --> 00:12:49,163
我觉得
I think-

168
00:12:49,204 --> 00:12:50,746
你听到了吗 我的狗狗?
Do you hear that my pet?

169
00:12:51,163 --> 00:12:54,121
她认为 她想要
She thinks. She wants.

170
00:12:54,871 --> 00:12:59,454
就好像她的功劳值得我关心她的索求似的
As if she's done something that warrants me caring about either of those things.

171
00:13:00,996 --> 00:13:03,329
我们一直干坐等待
We're just sitting and waiting.

172
00:13:03,496 --> 00:13:06,246
没有少女之力 宝库一无是处
Without the Maiden Power, the vault means nothing.

173
00:13:06,288 --> 00:13:07,829
让我把它带给您
Let me claim it for you.

174
00:13:07,871 --> 00:13:10,788
我会告诉你 我何时何地会需要你
I will tell you when and where you are needed.

175
00:13:10,829 --> 00:13:12,288
但是大人
But your grace.

176
00:13:13,329 --> 00:13:18,413
我想在我长久的人生经验中 已经表现了极大的耐心
I'd like to think I have shown a great deal of patience over my many years walking remnant...

177
00:13:18,788 --> 00:13:21,954
但我讨厌重复我说过的话
but I do hate repeating myself.

178
00:13:22,996 --> 00:13:25,371
你就在这待着
You will remain here.

179
00:13:26,163 --> 00:13:29,079
明 白 吗
Is that clear?

180
00:13:30,288 --> 00:13:32,913
是 我当然明白
Yes. Yes, of course.

181
00:13:33,704 --> 00:13:36,538
没有您 我一无是处
Without you, I am nothing.

182
00:13:46,871 --> 00:13:48,288
我知道她的意思
I know what she said.

183
00:13:48,329 --> 00:13:49,871
我只是想确认些东西
I just want to check on something.

184
00:13:50,079 --> 00:13:52,496
我们会在其他人察觉前回来
We'll be back before anyone realizes.

185
00:13:55,454 --> 00:13:59,121
我想看看阿米特竞技场还有没有动静
I want to see if anything is still going on at Amity Colosseum.

186
00:13:59,371 --> 00:14:01,704
塞壬没我懂那些小屁孩
Salem doesn't know those children like I do.

187
00:14:01,996 --> 00:14:06,163
她们不会放弃这些拯救世界的错误尝试
They wouldn't just abandon their misguided attempt to save the world.

188
00:14:10,996 --> 00:14:14,288
如果她不想来 我来呗
If she doesn't want to, I'll come.

189
00:14:14,913 --> 00:14:16,704
我一直在训练我的外像力
I've been working on my Semblance.

190
00:14:16,829 --> 00:14:18,246
我能帮忙
I can help.

191
00:14:18,579 --> 00:14:20,413
我不会告诉别人的
I won't tell anybody.

192
00:14:23,538 --> 00:14:25,913
你都偷听到了多少
How much did you overhear?

193
00:14:34,454 --> 00:14:38,329
你说得对 Ren 我...我确实是作弊入学
You're right Ren. I..I did cheat my way into Beacon.

194
00:14:39,413 --> 00:14:43,121
而我很高兴身边的人能让我看清
And I'm glad I had people around me to help me see that,

195
00:14:43,454 --> 00:14:45,538
我比那个错误更重要
I was bigger than that mistake.

196
00:14:45,829 --> 00:14:47,621
你身边也有人啊
You've got people around you too.

197
00:14:48,038 --> 00:14:50,579
你不必逼迫自己坚强
You don't have to force yourself to be strong.

198
00:14:51,954 --> 00:14:53,996
你越是回避自己的感受
The more you hide from what you're feeling,

199
00:14:54,371 --> 00:14:56,788
你就会觉得越孤独
the more alone you're going to feel.

200
00:14:57,496 --> 00:14:58,788
相信我
Trust me.

201
00:15:05,746 --> 00:15:08,746
如果还有人在乎 我找到了能修车的部件
If anyone cares, I found a part to fix the bike.

202
00:15:09,788 --> 00:15:13,829
所以 好耶 好消息
So, yay. Good news.

203
00:15:17,371 --> 00:15:20,788
无论如何 我很抱歉他对你说这些话
For what it's worth, I'm sorry he said that to you.

204
00:15:21,454 --> 00:15:23,621
我知道你走到这一步很不容易 Jaune
I know you've had to work hard to get here Jaune.

205
00:15:23,954 --> 00:15:25,996
我们现在压力都很大
We're all under a lot of stress right now.

206
00:15:26,288 --> 00:15:28,204
我以前也会把别人推开
I used to push people away too.

207
00:15:38,496 --> 00:15:44,079
Do you think she thinks less of me? For not helping out with Amity?

208
00:15:44,454 --> 00:15:47,496
Ruby是你妹妹 她永远都会爱你
Ruby is your sister. She's always going to love you,

209
00:15:47,538 --> 00:15:49,288
哪怕你们并不同意彼此
even if you disagree with each other.

210
00:15:50,579 --> 00:15:53,121
是的吧 Ruby
Yeah. Ruby.

211
00:15:57,288 --> 00:16:01,829
我得睡会 但是现在满脑子都是奥斯卡
I need to get some sleep but, I can't stop thinking about Oscar.

212
00:16:02,413 --> 00:16:06,788
你睡吧 我会保证Ren不会冻毙寒天
Go on. I'll make sure Ren doesn't brute himself to death out in the cold.

213
00:16:07,954 --> 00:16:10,704
多谢了 我就是感觉不太对
Thanks. I just have a bad feeling.

214
00:16:10,746 --> 00:16:12,704
事情总是会在变好前变得更糟
Things always seem to get worse before they get better.